{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step from a small business to a grand restaurant dream!</strong><br>In this demo version, you will discover the foundations of the <i>Service Please</i> world<br>by designing your restaurant according to your own taste.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095510/extras/b230c5f2bae7fe5a13d7867389fcba28.poster.avif?t=1760462163\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095510/extras/b230c5f2bae7fe5a13d7867389fcba28.webm?t=1760462163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create, Arrange, Beautify!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your restaurant as you wish with tables, chairs, kitchen equipment, lamps,<br>and garden items.<br>Every detail determines the atmosphere and customer interest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095510/extras/9a368291ed1a5761f7d8a6b7b4856419.poster.avif?t=1760462163\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095510/extras/9a368291ed1a5761f7d8a6b7b4856419.webm?t=1760462163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095510/extras/9a368291ed1a5761f7d8a6b7b4856419.mp4?t=1760462163\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Limited Content, Unlimited Imagination</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some items are locked in this version,<br>but all the essential design tools are in your hands!<br>Plan your space, reflect your style, and experiment with different layouts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This Is Just the Beginning!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the full version, you will experience quests, events, staff management,<br>and expanded decoration options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Now, build your restaurant and get ready to say \u201cService Please!\u201d</strong><br>Success is entirely in your hands.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4095510?t=1760462163","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4095510?t=1760462163","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095510/ae7d572ec2f2aa8e7093829fa343474cbd49de66/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760462163","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095510/ae7d572ec2f2aa8e7093829fa343474cbd49de66/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760462163","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step from a small business to a grand restaurant dream!</strong><br>In this demo version, you will discover the foundations of the <i>Service Please</i> world<br>by designing your restaurant according to your own taste.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095510/extras/b230c5f2bae7fe5a13d7867389fcb